~ start
#								global pos		zoom 	time	trans	ease type
#do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(750.0, -100.0), 0.5, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")

#							name 	x destination, speed, animate, moonwalk
#do! CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", 500.0, 		200.0,	 100.0, false, false)

# Make Fenn face correct direction - "left" or "right"
# do CutsceneManager.player_face("")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(35000.0,3200), 0.75, 1.5, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","left")
Fenn starry: WHOA! You're [color="B80006"]Az[/color]!! [wave freq=7 amp=30][color="B80006"]Sir Abdullah's[/color] daughter?[/wave]
Az annoy: [i]Seriously,[/i] dude. [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i]. Not a good time.
Fenn: Oh yeah! [wait=0.3]Where is everyone?[wait=0.3] [wave freq=7 amp=30]I'm Fenn, and I'm here to meet the Knights![/wave]
Az: Ugh. [i]Great timing.[/i]
Az annoy: Some rookie [color="8A0194"]Wizards[/color] locked them in the Council Chamber. I saw one of 'em head into the [color="0B4F4A"]Cellar[/color].
Fenn starry: [font_size=60]We have to help them!![wait=0.2] [shake level=10 rate=50 connected=0]ADVENTURE AWAITS!![/shake][/font_size]
Az annoy: [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30]NO.[/shake][/font_size] I [i]really[/i] need to grab something from my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]. [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough.[/i] Stay [i]here[/i].
Fenn: Hm... [wave freq=7 amp=30]no promises![/wave]
Az annoy: [shake level=7 rate=20 connected=0]Ugh[/shake]. Whatever.
do CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", 36352.0, 400, true, false)
do CutsceneManager.fade_to_black()
do CutsceneManager.remove_npc("Az")
do CutsceneManager.fade_from_black()
do EventFlags.set_flag("1-Az-Meet-GreatHall", true)
=> END